"""RF-02F archive boundary. Imports are inert; no fits, scoring, or selection prefill.

Production admission has no injectable trust arguments. SourceContext contains
immutable bytes/tuples, and its public properties return copies. Every later
origin read is checked against the originally admitted index again.

forecast_inputs returns origin, prepared_receipts, bank_prepared,
diagonal_outputs, source_laws {full, outer}, mapper_sources, mappers,
original_selection, and source_pointers. Laws are saved descriptors, not scores.
grade_inputs additionally requires the owning Store's read_publication callback
and expected_manifest_sha256. The callback MUST check its own durable index and
return the exact saved bytes. This module validates the envelope and membership;
the controller owns descriptor semantics, durability, and actual issuance time.
"""
